        howto["<b>How to read this</b><br/>Arrows are drawn for one relation only:<br/>which workflow a --workflow token runs.<br/>Layers 2 → 4 are composition, not flow —<br/>each box names who calls it, and repeats<br/>that owner as its colour."]
